# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the test suite.
#
# The tests act as real Wayland clients in-process (see tests/test_compositor.cpp
# for the pattern) and disconnect without destroying every wl_proxy first, which
# LSan reports as a leak inside libwayland-client. That is the harness being
# terse, not the library leaking: nothing here is allocated by luminaria.
#
# Deliberately narrow — one library, by name. Anything luminaria itself leaks
# still gets reported.
leak:libwayland-client
